'''Wrath of Hell (Deadly)''' is the 11th [[:Category:Cyclone Stages|Cyclone Stage]]. This stage introduces the [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]]-trait Cyclone, [[Aku Cyclone]]. It was added in [[Version 10.8 Update|Version 10.8]] and appears every Friday. Upon completion, the player has a 30% chance to unlock [[Aku Researcher (Rare Cat)|Aku Researcher]]. This is a [[No Continues]] stage.

